---
import '../components/lab.css';
---
<div class="cover" data-title="transformer training lab">
  <div class="section">lecture 2 · lab</div>
  <h1>transformer<br>training lab</h1>
  <p class="muted">from the attention equation to five models you implement, configure and train on your own machine</p>
  <div class="step road">
    <span>components</span><b>→</b><span>attention on a gpu</span><b>→</b><span>training</span><b>→</b><span>tensors</span><b>→</b><span>your five models</span>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .cover { align-self: flex-start; margin-left: 40px; }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 2.9em; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: .1em 0 .35em; }
  .cover .muted { font-size: .8em; max-width: 30em; margin: 0 0 1.4em; }
  .road { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .45em; font-size: .62em; color: var(--muted); }
  .road span { padding: .25em 0; }
  .road span:last-child { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .road b { color: var(--faint); font-weight: 400; }
</style>
